{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10266","headline":"送萧颖士赴东府得散字 · 殷少野","name":"送萧颖士赴东府得散字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官闲幕府下，聊以任纵诞。\n文学鲁仲尼，高标嵇中散。\n出门时雨润，对酒春风暖。\n感激知己恩，别离魂欲断。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷少野","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}